<title>LATVIA: MADONA FUR FIRM TO JOIN BOURSE FREE LIST.</title>
<headline>MADONA FUR FIRM TO JOIN BOURSE FREE LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange said on Friday that furrier Madona is to join the free list of the bourse from August 11.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that 351,981 shares will be quoted on the over-the-counter sector of the bourse.</p>
<p>The company made a loss of 288,033 lats in 1996 on turnover of 862,569 lats. Its production costs were 1.11 million lats.</p>
<p>Its biggest shareholder is the EVMA company, which has 51 percent followed by 18.25 percent which was sold in a public offering.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
